# RiverMind Pixel: the site's font, hand-drawn for rivermindpoker.com.
#
# Every glyph is a grid: "#" is a pixel, "." is empty. Rows 1 to 7 sit above
# the baseline (capital height 7, x-height 5); rows 8 and 9, when present,
# hang below it. The advance is the grid width plus one pixel of spacing.
# Digits are all 5 wide, so numbers line up in columns.
#
# One pixel is 100 font units and the em is 10 pixels, so the font is crisp
# at multiples of 10px (20px is 2x). scripts/pixel-art/font.js compiles this
# file into web/src/lib/art/fonts/rivermind-pixel.woff. GPL-3.0-or-later.

